WEBVTT

1
00:00:46.208 --> 00:00:49.809
Are you sure
Nawaam is really headed for Hy Izlan?

2
00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:54.250
Yep. at least that's where
we were told to rendezvous.

3
00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:58.809
But not sure how we're gonna
go about this alone.

4
00:00:58.833 --> 00:01:02.768
Nawaam's army is too big
for you to take on by yourself.

5
00:01:02.792 --> 00:01:04.559
It doesn't matter.

6
00:01:04.583 --> 00:01:07.934
If Nawaam's going to be there.
then my father will be too.

7
00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:09.667
We'll figure it out afterwards.

8
00:01:10.792 --> 00:01:14.018
You're making a "I'm gonna
fight him alone" face.

9
00:01:14.042 --> 00:01:17.707
That's very bold.

10
00:01:47.125 --> 00:01:48.958
This is where it all started.

11
00:01:53.875 --> 00:01:54.875
Who's there?

12
00:01:58.917 --> 00:02:01.582
Zhima. is that you?

13
00:02:07.125 --> 00:02:09.434
Master Zhima. you made it.

14
00:02:09.458 --> 00:02:11.268
I'm glad to see that you also made it.

15
00:02:11.292 --> 00:02:13.417
Four-Nines!

16
00:02:16.417 --> 00:02:19.250
What a pleasant surprise.
I didn't expect you to bring Kwana.

17
00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:20.851
Well. of course.

18
00:02:20.875 --> 00:02:24.768
I was ultimately convinced
after Juro handed me this.

19
00:02:24.792 --> 00:02:27.667
Hmm.

20
00:02:28.542 --> 00:02:30.643
Pleasure to make your acquaintance.

21
00:02:30.667 --> 00:02:32.393
My name is Homen.

22
00:02:32.417 --> 00:02:35.625
I am a masterless Jedi.
like Ethan and Kwana.

23
00:02:36.583 --> 00:02:38.750
Well. I appreciate you joining us today.

24
00:02:40.625 --> 00:02:41.958
Huh?

25
00:02:42.583 --> 00:02:45.542
<i>I'm spotting a lot of ships
coming out of hyperspace right now.</i>

26
00:02:46.375 --> 00:02:47.500
<i>Is it Nawaam's army?</i>

27
00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:50.208
No. Uh...

28
00:02:59.750 --> 00:03:02.059
<i>Come in.
Do you read me?</i>

29
00:03:02.083 --> 00:03:04.684
This is the Bibin Defense Fleet.

30
00:03:04.708 --> 00:03:06.958
We heard you could use
some extra firepower.

31
00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:09.166
Lady Tafflah!

32
00:03:11.625 --> 00:03:13.500
Sorry to keep everyone waiting.

33
00:03:14.667 --> 00:03:17.583
It took us a while
to rally all the troops.

34
00:03:19.042 --> 00:03:20.999
Hmm?

35
00:03:23.458 --> 00:03:25.059
<i>Has Nawaam attacked?</i>

36
00:03:25.083 --> 00:03:28.583
Oh. my. Here comes
a little latecomer to the party.

37
00:03:31.917 --> 00:03:33.726
And who could that be?

38
00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:35.518
<i>This is Lah Kara.</i>

39
00:03:35.542 --> 00:03:38.059
<i>Is my father. Lah Zhima. there?</i>

40
00:03:38.083 --> 00:03:40.125
Kara!

41
00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.750
I don't believe it...

42
00:04:04.792 --> 00:04:05.874
Kara...

43
00:04:09.292 --> 00:04:11.167
Oh. thank goodness.

44
00:04:12.458 --> 00:04:14.000
I missed you so much.

45
00:04:21.833 --> 00:04:23.666
Hmm?

46
00:04:27.542 --> 00:04:29.000
No! Father! Wait!

47
00:04:29.917 --> 00:04:33.226
Honestly. if you cut me down
right now. I wouldn't blame you.

48
00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:34.976
It would just be a tad unfortunate.

49
00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.976
seeing I'm currently
under your daughter's employ.

50
00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:39.559
It's the truth.

51
00:04:39.583 --> 00:04:41.559
A lot has happened since you've been gone.

52
00:04:41.583 --> 00:04:45.434
but basically. what he really wants to do
right now is fight for what is right.

53
00:04:45.458 --> 00:04:47.917
and now he's ready to fight alongside us.

54
00:04:59.958 --> 00:05:01.083
You believe me now?

55
00:05:02.292 --> 00:05:04.934
The color of your lightsaber
tells me all I need to know.

56
00:05:04.958 --> 00:05:06.000
Hmm.

57
00:05:12.708 --> 00:05:16.768
I'm sorry for everything. Kara.

58
00:05:16.792 --> 00:05:19.875
There are still so many things
I have yet to tell you about.

59
00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.476
It's okay.

60
00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:24.083
I think I understand now.

61
00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.250
She knows.

62
00:05:27.125 --> 00:05:28.684
Why'd you keep it a secret?

63
00:05:28.708 --> 00:05:30.750
We would've understood.

64
00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:48.750
<i>You're right.</i>

65
00:05:50.625 --> 00:05:53.750
When I think about it.
I never really was alone.

66
00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:57.500
That reminds me...

67
00:06:01.125 --> 00:06:03.208
I believe that this belongs to you.

68
00:06:08.750 --> 00:06:10.976
And I have something for you.
It's yours. right?

69
00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:12.000
Uh...

70
00:06:20.042 --> 00:06:22.292
And this last lightsaber is for you.

71
00:06:23.042 --> 00:06:26.809
Thank you. but I don't believe
I'm qualified to accept it.

72
00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:29.184
You're wrong. you absolutely do.

73
00:06:29.208 --> 00:06:31.708
Besides. I'm sure
this is what Juro would've wanted.

74
00:06:32.958 --> 00:06:34.667
- Uh...
- Hmm.

75
00:06:39.708 --> 00:06:42.083
Uh...

76
00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:45.292
Hmm.

77
00:06:48.042 --> 00:06:51.917
So. this must be the birth of the
new Jedi Order that Juro once dreamt of.

78
00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:55.559
Huh?

79
00:06:55.583 --> 00:06:59.167
I never wanted for you
to have to walk down this path. Kara.

80
00:07:02.292 --> 00:07:05.125
Did you strike someone down?

81
00:07:06.208 --> 00:07:07.208
Yes.

82
00:07:07.667 --> 00:07:09.101
But take it from me.

83
00:07:09.125 --> 00:07:13.184
for what it's worth.
your daughter is really strong.

84
00:07:13.208 --> 00:07:16.518
I mean. she's up there
with the strongest Jedi I've faced.

85
00:07:16.542 --> 00:07:17.542
She would be.

86
00:07:18.667 --> 00:07:20.768
But despite all of your strength.

87
00:07:20.792 --> 00:07:23.500
I would've never chosen
a Jedi's life for you.

88
00:07:24.375 --> 00:07:28.393
There are times when a Jedi
must make heartbreaking choices.

89
00:07:28.417 --> 00:07:30.750
It isn't easy to make such decisions.

90
00:07:31.708 --> 00:07:33.393
And being strong doesn't mean

91
00:07:33.417 --> 00:07:37.208
you will automatically be standing
on the right side of justice.

92
00:07:38.167 --> 00:07:39.167
I've learned that.

93
00:07:40.458 --> 00:07:43.875
But then. how else are we supposed
to help those who are in need?

94
00:07:46.458 --> 00:07:49.416
That's a question
I have yet to find an answer to.

95
00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.417
But there's more to it than just strength.

96
00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:14.518
Otherwise. we would be
no different from Nawaam.

97
00:08:14.542 --> 00:08:18.292
If it wasn't for what happened that day.
he might've become a great Jedi.

98
00:08:19.958 --> 00:08:21.833
Not... From Nawaam...

99
00:08:22.708 --> 00:08:23.791
I mean. I guess.

100
00:08:25.208 --> 00:08:27.583
But what was he like?
You knew Nawaam. right?

101
00:08:28.542 --> 00:08:32.541
He was just a youngling when Reno
tried to bring back the Jedi Order.

102
00:08:33.625 --> 00:08:38.559
<i>That day. when I chose
to take the wrong path. he was there.</i>

103
00:08:38.583 --> 00:08:41.083
<i>and he became convinced
that it was the right one.</i>

104
00:08:43.375 --> 00:08:46.917
<i>So. you see. I am the one
who turned him into a monster.</i>

105
00:08:56.792 --> 00:08:58.559
<i>Oh. stay sharp. everyone.</i>

106
00:08:58.583 --> 00:09:01.249
It looks like our guest of honor's
just arrived.

107
00:09:05.750 --> 00:09:08.351
It appears that they
got the jump on us somehow.

108
00:09:08.375 --> 00:09:10.934
They're still no more
than a disorganized mess.

109
00:09:10.958 --> 00:09:13.583
Indeed.
And that much easier to crush.

110
00:09:14.542 --> 00:09:16.768
Activate the tractor beam.

111
00:09:16.792 --> 00:09:18.874
And bring in the kyber crystal.

112
00:09:33.250 --> 00:09:34.434
We're being pulled in.

113
00:09:34.458 --> 00:09:37.476
Our allies bought us time
and slowed them down.

114
00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:39.518
but it was just a matter of time.

115
00:09:39.542 --> 00:09:42.726
All of you are going to have to attack
the fortress from the outside.

116
00:09:42.750 --> 00:09:43.833
Father. what about you?

117
00:09:44.708 --> 00:09:46.792
I have to stay here
and defend the crystal.

118
00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:50.208
That's why I came here in the first place.

119
00:09:51.375 --> 00:09:54.792
We cannot allow Nawaam
to get his hands on that crystal.

120
00:09:55.625 --> 00:09:58.559
Because they are unprepared
for the consequences

121
00:09:58.583 --> 00:10:00.934
that will happen if they use that thing.

122
00:10:00.958 --> 00:10:03.042
What do you mean?

123
00:10:04.583 --> 00:10:08.143
This crystal's purity grade is too high.

124
00:10:08.167 --> 00:10:10.893
The power that would
come from something this size

125
00:10:10.917 --> 00:10:12.833
would make it impossible to control.

126
00:10:13.792 --> 00:10:18.167
Imagine daring to put a crystal like this
inside a cannon of that magnitude.

127
00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:21.750
<i>It won't just obliterate its target...</i>

128
00:10:26.333 --> 00:10:28.393
Everything in its line of fire.

129
00:10:28.417 --> 00:10:32.042
from here to the edge of the galaxy.
will be wiped from existence.

130
00:10:39.208 --> 00:10:43.374
So the fate of the galaxy is resting
on the outcome of our little battle.

131
00:10:51.625 --> 00:10:53.917
Well. then I'm going out
for a spin.

132
00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:56.208
I'll leave the rest to you.

133
00:10:59.667 --> 00:11:01.851
You two should go and join
the defense fleet.

134
00:11:01.875 --> 00:11:04.226
and attack Nawaam's fortress
from the outside.

135
00:11:04.250 --> 00:11:06.309
I'm not leaving you. Father!

136
00:11:06.333 --> 00:11:07.476
You must.

137
00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:09.559
I have to do this alone.

138
00:11:09.583 --> 00:11:12.518
If something were to happen.
I need to know that you'll survive.

139
00:11:12.542 --> 00:11:13.542
But. I...

140
00:11:14.292 --> 00:11:18.184
If the worst comes to pass out there.
promise me you'll run.

141
00:11:18.208 --> 00:11:21.351
Choose an honest life.
not a glorious death.

142
00:11:21.375 --> 00:11:23.167
Hmm.

143
00:11:24.583 --> 00:11:25.958
May the Force be with you.

144
00:11:28.583 --> 00:11:30.207
- Come on.
- Uh...

145
00:11:40.917 --> 00:11:44.643
Bhozn. you will be
in charge of handling the enemy fleet.

146
00:11:44.667 --> 00:11:47.184
Do not fail again.

147
00:11:47.208 --> 00:11:49.684
And what will you be doing?

148
00:11:49.708 --> 00:11:52.042
I'll be retrieving
the kyber crystal...

149
00:11:52.917 --> 00:11:54.684
with your permission.

150
00:11:54.708 --> 00:11:55.708
Yes.

151
00:11:59.833 --> 00:12:01.434
Does it seem odd to you

152
00:12:01.458 --> 00:12:05.351
that Gennoh would rather retrieve
a crystal than lead this battle?

153
00:12:05.375 --> 00:12:08.143
He's not seeking a crystal.
but rather. revenge.

154
00:12:08.167 --> 00:12:09.208
Revenge?

155
00:12:24.125 --> 00:12:26.559
Attention all vessels.

156
00:12:26.583 --> 00:12:29.684
<i>Our target is the enemy fortress's
power center!</i>

157
00:12:29.708 --> 00:12:31.458
<i>Hit 'em with everything you've got!</i>

158
00:12:32.042 --> 00:12:34.417
The rest of you.
support the Meteorite Fleet!

159
00:12:35.042 --> 00:12:36.833
Draw the enemy this way!

160
00:12:39.208 --> 00:12:42.268
The fate of the galaxy
depends on this battle.

161
00:12:42.292 --> 00:12:45.249
Everyone's future is in your hands.

162
00:13:08.625 --> 00:13:10.226
Listen up. you brutes!

163
00:13:10.250 --> 00:13:14.125
I don't want a single one of their ships
able to reach Fort Dominion!

164
00:13:48.667 --> 00:13:51.583
I knew you'd be here. Lah Zhima.

165
00:13:53.625 --> 00:13:57.059
Wait. we have to turn around now!

166
00:13:57.083 --> 00:13:58.143
But why?

167
00:13:58.167 --> 00:14:00.351
My father's in danger!

168
00:14:00.375 --> 00:14:01.375
I can sense it.

169
00:14:07.875 --> 00:14:09.750
Kara!

170
00:14:11.333 --> 00:14:14.101
Well. I guess we have no choice
but to turn back around too.

171
00:14:14.125 --> 00:14:15.125
Agreed.

172
00:14:15.792 --> 00:14:16.792
All righty.

173
00:14:20.042 --> 00:14:23.643
Listen. You cannot use
this temple's crystal as a weapon.

174
00:14:23.667 --> 00:14:26.726
You will not be able
to control what it does.

175
00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:27.976
What of it?

176
00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:30.393
I don't care what happens.

177
00:14:30.417 --> 00:14:33.249
All I care about is defeating you.

178
00:14:42.917 --> 00:14:44.707
Fine. As you wish.

179
00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:56.309
So. you're using your new upgrades
to track my moves.

180
00:14:56.333 --> 00:14:59.541
Precisely. but there's more...

181
00:15:01.333 --> 00:15:03.917
Let's see how you do
against these upgrades!

182
00:15:10.125 --> 00:15:11.601
Father!

183
00:15:11.625 --> 00:15:13.476
Kara. why did you come back?

184
00:15:13.500 --> 00:15:15.518
If I were you. I'd stay focused!

185
00:15:15.542 --> 00:15:16.999
Watch out!

186
00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:03.375
Now what? Lightsabers
and blasters don't work on that thing.

187
00:16:04.167 --> 00:16:06.143
Forget about saving Zhima.

188
00:16:06.167 --> 00:16:08.583
at this rate. we won't even
be able to save ourselves.

189
00:16:09.333 --> 00:16:10.726
That's not true.

190
00:16:10.750 --> 00:16:12.101
What do you mean?

191
00:16:12.125 --> 00:16:13.434
Take a closer look.

192
00:16:13.458 --> 00:16:14.518
See the shield?

193
00:16:14.542 --> 00:16:17.226
I think it's having trouble
maintaining it.

194
00:16:17.250 --> 00:16:20.518
which means our attacks
are doing some damage.

195
00:16:20.542 --> 00:16:22.226
So. at that power level.

196
00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.809
it can't keep its shield
deployed constantly.

197
00:16:24.833 --> 00:16:27.207
Okay. But how do we take that thing down?

198
00:16:41.333 --> 00:16:42.934
Something's wrong out there.

199
00:16:42.958 --> 00:16:44.833
We have to wrap this up and help them.

200
00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:46.791
Uh. Kara?

201
00:17:02.542 --> 00:17:05.851
Despite
all of your Jedi training.

202
00:17:05.875 --> 00:17:08.667
you can't outmatch
my speed with this body.

203
00:17:09.542 --> 00:17:12.375
And this time. I will defeat you.

204
00:17:13.958 --> 00:17:15.333
How foolish.

205
00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:52.541
Oh. no!

206
00:19:02.792 --> 00:19:04.167
Hmm.

207
00:19:08.208 --> 00:19:09.917
This is bad.
They have the crystal.

208
00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:14.351
I'd scold you for coming back.
but we do not have the time.

209
00:19:14.375 --> 00:19:15.893
Listen.

210
00:19:15.917 --> 00:19:18.750
You must do everything you can
to destroy the kyber cannon.

211
00:19:19.375 --> 00:19:21.292
They cannot be allowed to use it.

212
00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:23.000
What about you?

213
00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.708
I'll find Nawaam so I can end this.
once and for all.
